# 相依與暫存
/.bundle
/log/*
/tmp/*
!/log/.keep
!/tmp/.keep
/tmp/pids/*
!/tmp/pids/.keep
/tmp/storage/*
!/tmp/storage/.keep
/storage/*
!/storage/.keep
/public/assets
.DS_Store

# 金鑰：絕不進 Git
/.env*
!/.env.example
/config/master.key
/config/credentials/*.key

# Tailwind 編譯輸出
/app/assets/builds/*
!/app/assets/builds/.keep

# 測試與 CI
/tmp/screenshots
/coverage
/node_modules
